[{"id":184435076,"discussion_id":"15d79ba2de6bc3845fa88b8fd5e89fea439087c1","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `threshold_grad_v2_d` 算子当输入为 NaN 时的精度问题。核心改动是将比较模式从 `COMPARE_MODE_GT`（大于）切换为 `COMPARE_MODE_LE`（小于等于），并相应交换 `Select` 操作中 `grad` 与 `zero` 两个数据输入的位置，使正常数值路径的语义保持不变，但 NaN 输入场景下的输出行为从\"清零\"变为\"保留梯度\"，从而避免 NaN 导致的精度异常。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **比较模式常量变更**：将 `COMPARE_MODE_GT`（值为 1）替换为 `COMPARE_MODE_LE`（值为 3），翻转了阈值比较的逻辑方向，影响文件 `activation/threshold_grad_v2_d/op_kernel/arch35/threshold_grad_v2_d_dag.h`。\n- **`Select` 数据参数顺序交换**：在 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag`、`ThresholdGradV2DInt32Dag` 和 `ThresholdGradV2DDag` 三个 DAG 结构体中，`Vec::Select` 的 `data_zero` 与 `OpCopyInGradCast` 参数位置互换，配合比较模式反转以保持正常数值路径的输出语义不变。\n- **NaN 输入行为修正**：由于 NaN 与任何值的比较均返回 `false`，旧逻辑（`GT` + 原始 Select 顺序）会在 NaN 时选中 `data_zero` 导致梯度被错误清零；新逻辑（`LE` + 交换后的 Select 顺序）在 NaN 时选中 `OpCopyInGradCast`，使梯度得以保留通过。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-12T14:41:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T14:47:01+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184435078,"discussion_id":"8603e8a680b885e4da44a106851c70e50c1fd7fe","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-12T14:41:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T14:59:34+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184435116,"discussion_id":"e60564d6d7c4caa32008e38c72430014ed6b6ffa","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitc